  "headline": "Prabowo Subianto Announces Major Teacher Initiatives On Teacher Day",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Subianto Announces Major Teacher Initiatives",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto marked National Teacher Day with announcements on professional certifications, salary benefits, and international training…",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto launched the Studio Guru platform to improve access to quality education via distance learning.",
    "The government pledged to transition over 240,000 part-time teachers to full-time status and confirmed over 90 trillion rupiah in total benefits.",
    "New international training programs for educators in Canada and Russia are scheduled to commence in 2027."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "During the 2026 National Teacher Day commemoration at the Sentul International Convention Center in Bogor, President Prabowo Subianto unveiled several initiatives aimed at supporting Indonesian educators. The government reported that certified teachers under the Ministry of Religious Affairs have reached over 826,000, representing an 86.5 percent increase. Financial support for teachers, including both civil servants and non-ASN staff, has reached a total of more than 90 trillion rupiah. Beyond financial incentives, the president introduced the Studio Guru program to facilitate distance learning and emphasized the importance of compassion in pedagogy. The administration also announced plans to convert approximately 242,482 part-time contract teachers to full-time positions without additional testing, alongside a recruitment drive for nearly 465,000 civil servants. Additionally, international professional development opportunities for teachers in Canada and Russia are set to begin in 2027.",
